  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br />i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, the minimum value of the function<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
